"P3253464627" "So you're {HeroName}. I've heard good things about you, kid, but you should know, I've worked with the best. The Damsel of Distress. Empyreal. The Crimson Fist. They all worked with me in their heydays, and they all knew one thing: I will not let my heroes down. With that in mind, I'd like you to take a quick tour through the Broken Teeth. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>The Red Caps are out of control in this area, and I need you to help push them back.</A>"
